## Pick one, not all four

The Rijksmuseum, the Van Gogh Museum, the Stedelijk and the Moco all sit on the same square, with the Concertgebouw at the far end. Trying to do more than one in a day is how people end up remembering neither. Book a timed ticket in advance, or ask at reception and we will sort it for you.

